303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Tajir is a B2B e-commerce marketplace catering to local mom-and-pop stores in Pakistan. It simplifies the inventory procurement process, providing an array of FMCG products through an Urdu-only app-based platform. 2xN, AAVCF, AAVCF3, Dylan Field, and Emles Venture Partners are 5 of 24 investors who have invested in Tajir. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [14]
>>
