306 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Zameen.pk is Pakistan's largest and most trusted property portal. It connects buyers and sellers of real estate, featuring a vast database of properties for sale, purchase, and rent. The platform has revolutionized the real estate industry with its user-friendly interface and advanced search filters. Investors of Zameen.com include Frontier Digital Ventures, Vostok New Ventures and Dubizzle Group.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
