/ActualText ( 6. Abhi \(2021\))
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
312 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Abhi, an embedded finance platform launched in 2021, empowers SMEs, the underbanked, and the employed sector in Pakistan. As a licensed NBFC, Abhi is backed by global fintech venture funds, including YCombinator, VEF, Global Ventures, and SpeedInvest, raising approximately USD 22 million in equity with a valuation of USD 90 million. Abhi is offering solutions like Earned Wage Access \(EWA\), Payroll Processing, Payroll Financing, and SME Financing, its flagship EWA product allows employees to instantly withdraw earned salaries via its app, SMS, or salary card.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (7. PostEx \(2020\))
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (PostEx, launched in 2020, is a rapidly growing logistics and fintech platform in Pakistan that addresses cash flow challenges for e-commerce businesses. It integrates last-mile delivery with upfront cash services, offering cash-on-delivery \(COD\) with instant payments to enhance liquidity and support faster business growth. Backed by global venture capital firms like MSA Capital and Shorooq Partners, PostEx has raised over USD 15 million in equity funding.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (05)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
