<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Pakistan's start-up ecosystem is a complex interplay of government agencies, private sector entities, and academic institutions. Several key players contribute to its development and support. These organizations offer a range of services, from funding and incubation to capacity building and policy advocacy.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1221 0 R
/ActualText (Ministry of Information Technology and Telecommunication \(MOITT\): Oversees the IT sector, provides policy direction, and supports initiatives like Ignite.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
