<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1228 0 R
/ActualText (National Database and Registration Authority \(NADRA\): Provide secure and efficient digital identity verification services, enabling streamlined onboarding processes for businesses and customers.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
