/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (It's important to note that the start-up landscape is dynamic, and the definition can vary across different countries and regions. The overall goal is to capture the essence of early-stage, innovative businesses with high growth potential. However, in case of Pakistan the varied definition of start-up is the impedes the progress towards the desired outcome. )
/E (It's important to note that the start-up landscape is dynamic, and the definition can vary across different countries and regions. The overall goal is to capture the essence of early-stage, innovative businesses with high growth potential. However, in case of Pakistan the varied definition of start-up is the impedes the progress towards the desired outcome. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
