/Pg 20 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
515 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The federal government, through the Ministry of Finance, presented the Companies \(Amendments\) Bill, 2020, which was approved by the National Assembly. The SECP incorporated numerous amendments aimed at promoting start-ups, improving the business climate, and easing business operations.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
