/ActualText (Section 458A was introduced to enhance the regulatory framework for start-ups and improve the ease of doing business. This section allows the SECP to implement measures that formalize existing practices, promote financial technology, and facilitate market entry and exit for start-ups. It supports innovation through regulatory sandboxes, crowdfunding, digital assets, and smart contracts, and encourages the adoption of technology for compliance and risk assessment.)
