/T (Overall, India's start-up ecosystem thrives due to a combination of impressive private sector growth, proactive government support, and a focus on fostering innovation across all levels. DPIIT registration for start-ups provides streamlined compliance with 9 environmental and labor laws, facilitates swift dissolution under the Insolvency & Bankruptcy Code, and offers exemptions such as tax benefits, tender deposit waivers, and three years of income tax relief. Recognized start-ups under DPIIT can bypass minimum requirements, turnover or other experience for government tenders as well. )
/E (Overall, India's start-up ecosystem thrives due to a combination of impressive private sector growth, proactive government support, and a focus on fostering innovation across all levels. DPIIT registration for start-ups provides streamlined compliance with 9 environmental and labor laws, facilitates swift dissolution under the Insolvency & Bankruptcy Code, and offers exemptions such as tax benefits, tender deposit waivers, and three years of income tax relief. Recognized start-ups under DPIIT can bypass minimum requirements, turnover or other experience for government tenders as well. )
