/T (D. Support  i. Geographic Concentration The majority of tech hubs and labs are concentrated in major cities like Islamabad, Lahore, and Karachi. This centralization limits access to resources for entrepreneurs in tier 2 and tier 3 cities, hindering the growth of the innovation economy across the country. Expanding support infrastructure to these areas is essential for inclusive growth.)
